  english:
    title: ABC Type Fire Estinguisher
    message: ABC-type fire extinguishers can be used for solid, liquid, and gas fires.
      They are also suitable for electrical fires. They work by suppressing the fire,
      and the application should be directed at the base of the flames.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0656b90d7be8c01498a6b0fe4c388df1, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "ABC \u2013 Elektrik Tipi Yang\u0131n T\xFCp\xFC: "
    message: "ABC tipi yang\u0131n t\xFCpleri; kat\u0131, s\u0131v\u0131 ve gaz yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda
      kullan\u0131labilir. Elektrik yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda da g\xFCvenle tercih
      edilir. Yang\u0131n\u0131 bo\u011Farak s\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCr, m\xFCdahale s\u0131ras\u0131nda
      alevin taban\u0131na odaklan\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd1899f2d51037047a80d3f13b140228, type: 2}
